PREAMBLE

The OASIS API (Open Advanced Secure Interoperable Scalable-System) and all
associated technologies including HoloNET, STAR ODK, STARNET, Web6 and
related works (together "the Software") are the original intellectual
property of NextGen World Ltd, created over more than
fifteen years.

This licence exists to keep the source visible and available for learning,
research, evaluation and Internal Use, while ensuring that no individual or
organisation commercially exploits or externally deploys this technology
without entering into a commercial relationship with NextGen.

This is not an open-source licence as defined by the Open Source Initiative.
It is a source-available licence with an external deployment restriction and
a dual-licensing model.

